L["Header Bar"] = "标题条带"
L["Show header bars"] = "显示板块标题栏"
L["Draws a colored gradient bar behind each section header (Quests, Campaign, World Quests, and so on), for a look closer to the default Blizzard tracker. Off by default."] = "在板块标题后方绘制渐变条带，更接近暴雪原生追踪器样式，默认关闭。"
L["Bar Color"] = "条带颜色"
L["Brightest end of the bar gradient. The other end is the same color darkened."] = "条带渐变的亮色端，另一端为同颜色加深。"
L["Bar Style"] = "条带样式"
L["Header Bar 1 is a horizontal gradient (bright on the left, dark on the right). Header Bar 2 is a vertical gradient (bright at the top, dark at the bottom). Bar Color, Bar Height, and Soft edges all apply to whichever style you pick."] = "标题条带1：水平渐变（左亮右暗）；标题条带2：垂直渐变（上亮下暗）。条带颜色、高度、柔化边缘全部生效。"
L["Soft edges"] = "柔和边缘"
L["Feathers the top, left, and right edges of the header bar so it blends into the UI instead of sitting in a hard box. The gradient color is unchanged. Only applies while Header bars is on. Off by default."] = "标题条带上、左、右边缘做羽化，和界面融合，渐变颜色不变；仅开启标题条带时生效，默认关闭。"
L["Bar Height"] = "条带高度"
L["How tall the section-header bar is. The bar is centered on the header row, so larger values fill more of it."] = "板块标题条带高度，条带居中，数值越高占用高度越大。"
L["Edge Softness"] = "边缘柔化度"
L["How soft the header bar's feathered edges are when Soft edges is on. Higher is softer, lower tightens toward a hard edge."] = "开启柔化边缘后，控制标题条带边缘羽化程度；数值越高越柔和。"
L["Colors & Dimensions"] = "颜色与尺寸"
L["Reset to Defaults"] = "恢复默认设置"
L["Reset every setting on this tab to its defaults? The interface will reload."] = "确定将本标签页所有设置恢复默认？界面将会重载。"
L["Restores every control on this tab, including the zone bar block, to its default. Other tabs are left alone."] = "将本标签页全部选项（包含区域进度条）恢复默认，其他标签页不受影响。"
L["Quest Title Color Override"] = "强制任务标题颜色"
L["When cleared, falls back to difficulty coloring or default yellow."] = "清空后将使用任务难度颜色或默认黄色。"
L["Use class color for titles"] = "任务标题使用职业颜色"
L["Colors quest, achievement, and endeavor titles with the class color of the character you are currently logged in on. Overrides the color above while it is on. Off by default."] = "使用当前登录角色职业颜色渲染任务、成就、活动标题。开启后覆盖上面设置，默认关闭。"
L["Use title color for completed quests"] = "已完成任务使用标题文字颜色"
L["Instead of green."] = "替换绿色显示。"
L["Section Header Color"] = "板块标题颜色"
L["Color of the Quests, Campaign and World Quests headings."] = "任务、战役、世界任务板块标题文字颜色。"
L["Use class color for headers"] = "板块标题使用职业颜色"
L["Colors the section headers (Quests, Campaign, and so on) with the class color of the character you are currently logged in on. Overrides the color above while it is on. Off by default."] = "使用当前登录角色职业颜色渲染板块标题。开启后覆盖上面设置，默认关闭。"
L["Divider Line Color"] = "分隔线颜色"
L["Sets the color of the thin line under each section header. Defaults to the original gold."] = "设置每个板块标题下方细分割线颜色，默认为原生金色。"
L["Tracker Scale"] = "追踪框缩放"
L["Scales the whole tracker. Takes effect immediately out of combat."] = "整体缩放追踪框。脱离战斗后立即生效。"
L["Block Spacing"] = "区块间距"
L["Vertical gap between each entry and between sections."] = "条目之间、板块之间垂直间距。"
L["Line Spacing"] = "行间距"
L["Adds vertical space between a quest's objective lines, across the whole tracker. 0 keeps the default spacing."] = "全局调整任务目标行之间的垂直间距。填0使用默认间距。"
L["Header Spacing"] = "标题间距"
L["Adds or removes space around section headers and beneath each quest's title. 0 keeps the default spacing."] = "调整板块标题四周以及每个任务标题下方间距。填0使用默认间距。"
L["Quest Rows"] = "任务行"
L["Row Layout"] = "行布局"
L["How each quest is drawn in the tracker. |cffffffffPlain|r is the default look - text straight on the tracker background. |cffffffffCard|r gives every quest its own panel with a background and border, which makes long lists easier to read apart."] = "任务在追踪器中的渲染方式。|cffffffff普通|r：文字直接显示在追踪器背景；|cffffffff卡片|r：每个任务独立带边框面板，长列表更容易区分。"
L["Fill color behind each quest card. Only used while Row Layout is set to Card."] = "任务卡片背景填充色，仅行布局设为卡片模式生效。"
L["Outline color around each quest card. Only used while Row Layout is set to Card."] = "任务卡片边框描边颜色，仅行布局设为卡片模式生效。"
L["How thick the card outline is, in pixels. 0 hides the outline and leaves just the fill."] = "卡片边框像素粗细，填0只保留填充色，隐藏边框线。"
L["Card Padding"] = "卡片内边距"
L["Breathing room between a card's edge and the text inside it. Larger values make taller cards."] = "卡片边缘与内部文字的内边距，数值越大卡片越高。"
L["Tint cards by quest type"] = "按任务类型修改卡片色调"
L["Gives campaign, legendary, dungeon and raid entries their own card color. Anything else uses the plain background color above."] = "战役、传说、地下城、团队副本任务使用独立卡片颜色，其余任务使用普通背景色。"
L["Campaign"] = "战役"
L["Card color for campaign entries. Needs Tint cards by quest type switched on."] = "战役任务卡片颜色，需要开启“按任务类型着色卡片”。"
L["Legendary"] = "传说"
L["Card color for legendary entries. Needs Tint cards by quest type switched on."] = "传说任务卡片颜色，需要开启“按任务类型着色卡片”。"
L["Dungeon"] = "地下城"
L["Card color for dungeon entries. Needs Tint cards by quest type switched on."] = "地下城任务卡片颜色，需要开启“按任务类型着色卡片”。"
L["Raid"] = "团队副本"
L["Card color for raid entries. Needs Tint cards by quest type switched on."] = "团队副本任务卡片颜色，需要开启“按任务类型着色卡片”。"
L["Zone Progress Bar"] = "区域进度条"
L["Show zone progress bar"] = "显示区域进度条"
L["Approximate questline progress."] = "任务线大致进度"
L["Float as a movable bar"] = "浮动可拖动条带"
L["Drag to move, right-click to lock or reset. Unticked, the bar becomes an ordinary tracker section instead and only Bar Texture and Bar Color still apply to it."] = "拖拽移动，右键锁定/重置。取消勾选则变为普通追踪板块，仅条带材质、条带颜色生效。"
L["Fills the floating bar behind its text."] = "浮动条带文字后方填充底色。"
L["Background color and opacity for the floating bar. While this is unset the bar uses a plain black fill that fades slightly once locked."] = "浮动进度条的背景颜色与透明度。未设置时使用纯黑色填充，锁定后会轻微淡化。"
L["Draws a border around the floating bar."] = "为浮动条带绘制边框。"
L["Border color and opacity for the floating bar."] = "浮动条带的边框颜色与透明度。"
L["Zone Bar Scale"] = "区域进度条缩放"
L["Size of the floating bar. The docked section follows the tracker's own scale instead."] = "浮动栏尺寸。锚定板块会跟随追踪框整体缩放。"
L["Font for the floating bar's zone name, count and percentage. The docked section uses the tracker font."] = "浮动条带区域名、计数、百分比字体；固定板块使用追踪器字体。"
L["Bar Texture"] = "条带材质"
L["Sets the fill texture of the zone progress bar. Textures added by other media addons (such as SharedMedia, ElvUI, or Details) appear here too."] = "设置区域进度条填充材质。SharedMedia、ElvUI、Details等媒体插件提供的材质也会在此列出。"
L["Fill color and opacity of the bar itself."] = "条带本体填充颜色与透明度。"
L["Header Color"] = "标题颜色"
L["Color of the zone name on the floating bar. The docked section uses the section header color."] = "浮动条带区域名称颜色；固定板块使用板块标题颜色。"
L["Count Color"] = "计数文字颜色"
L["Color of the completed-of-total count on the floating bar."] = "浮动条带上已完成/总计数文字颜色。"
L["Show progress bars"] = "显示进度条"

